summary.label:
Get more likes and views in your posts with this simple app!
No registration required.
Simple interface.

Functions:
- generation of hashtags from the photo;
- save your hashtags;
- repost Instagram photo;
- popular, trending hashtags for your business*;
- change hashtags language**;
- filtering of banned hashtags in Instagram;
- add prefix to your text message;
- taking a photo from camera for uploading;
- upload a photo from your gallery;
- send photo and hashtag to Instagram app,
- unlimited usage, no registration and additional purchases required!

Create hashtags using a self-learning neural network. Quickly and simply.
Upload your photo and get a list of hashtags.
Popular hashtags will help you to get more followers, views and likes. 
In Premium version unlocked all functions, no ads and all new features and fixes will be first.

*Do not abuse popular hashtags too often.
**Most of the tags have been translated in an automated fashion, so sometimes the multilingual results in languages other than English might be far from perfect.

Please note:
You can use up to 30 tags on a post. If you include more than 30 tags on a single photo/video, your comment won't post.

Please leave your feedback for the improvement of the application.
